```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Patient / Evaluator
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant M4 as Model 4 (EfficientNetB0)
    participant M1 as Model 1 (XGBoost)
    participant M2 as Model 2 (PHQ-9/GAD-7)
    participant M3 as Model 3 (Multimodal Speech)
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL

    alt Pathway A: MRI-Only Analysis
        User->>FE: Select "MRI Scan Analysis"
        FE->>API: POST /api/assessments (type: MRI_ONLY)
        API->>DB: INSERT assessments (type=MRI_ONLY)
        User->>FE: Upload 2D Brain MRI Slice (PNG/JPEG)
        FE->>API: POST /api/mri/analyze (assessment_id, image_file)
        API->>M4: Preprocess (224x224x3) & Infer
        M4-->>API: 4-Class Probabilities + Predicted Class
        API->>DB: INSERT mri_assessments (probabilities, predicted_class)
        API-->>FE: MRI Analysis Response
        FE-->>User: Display MRI Prediction & Confidence Distribution
    else Pathway B: Multimodal Cognitive Assessment
        User->>FE: Select "Cognitive Assessment"
        FE->>API: POST /api/assessments (type: COGNITIVE)
        API->>DB: INSERT assessments (type=COGNITIVE)
        User->>FE: Complete PHQ-9 & GAD-7 Questionnaires
        FE->>M2: Calculate Severity Scores & Cutoffs (S >= 10)
        User->>FE: Play 5 Cognitive Games
        FE->>API: POST /api/games/submit (telemetry & timings)
        API->>M1: Compute 47 Features & XGBoost Regression
        M1-->>API: Cognitive Performance Score (0-100)
        User->>FE: Record Boston Cookie Theft Description Audio
        FE->>API: POST /api/speech/analyze (audio/webm blob)
        API->>API: FFmpeg -> 16kHz PCM WAV
        API->>M3: Wav2Vec2 + 42 Acoustic + DistilBERT -> Softmax
        M3-->>API: Probabilities (HC, MCI, Dementia)
        API->>API: Execute Rule-Based Fusion (50% Games, 50% Speech)
        API->>API: Attach Mental Health Context Flags (from M2)
        API->>DB: Store Results in cognitive_games, speech_assessments, model3_results
        API-->>FE: Comprehensive Assessment Payload
        FE-->>User: Display 3-tier Conclusion, Breakdown & Context
    end
```
